================================================================================
    CAN-LOGGER-DECODER: MCP2515 TO HOST CONTROLLER ASCII WIRING SCHEMATIC
================================================================================

+-------------------------+                     +------------------------------+
|     HOST CONTROLLER     |                     |    MCP2515 CAN MODULE BOARD   |
|   (Arduino/ESP32/RPi)   |                     |    (Controller + Transceiver)|
|                         |                     |                              |
|          [3.3V / 5.0V] o+-------------------->o [VCC]                        |
|                  [GND] o+-------------------->o [GND]                        |
|                         |                     |                              |
|           [SPI CS/SS]  o+-------------------->o [CS]   (Active-LOW Select)   |
|           [SPI MOSI]   o+-------------------->o [SI]   (Slave Data In)       |
|           [SPI MISO]   o<--------------------+o [SO]   (Slave Data Out)*     |
|           [SPI SCK]    o+-------------------->o [SCK]  (Serial Clock)        |
|                         |                     |                              |
|           [GPIO INT]   o<--------+-----------+o [INT]  (Active-LOW Interrupt)|
|                         |        |            |                              |
|                         |       [10k Pull-up] |                              |
|                         |        |            |                              |
|                         |       (VCC)         |                              |
|                         |                     |         DIFFERENTIAL BUS     |
|                         |                     |                              |
|                         |                     | [CAN_H] o---+----------------+===> CAN_H Bus Line
|                         |                     |             |                |
|                         |                     |            [120 Ohm]         |    (Terminator Jumper
|                         |                     |             | (if endpoint)  |     enabled if endpoint)
|                         |                     | [CAN_L] o---+----------------+===> CAN_L Bus Line
+-------------------------+                     +------------------------------+

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* LEVEL SHIFTER NOTE FOR 3.3V HOSTS (ESP32, STM32, Raspberry Pi):
  When powering MCP2515 at 5.0V, the SO pin outputs 5.0V logic.
  Use a bidirectional level shifter or a voltage divider on SO:
  MCP2515 [SO] o----[ 1k Ohm ]----o----[ 2k Ohm ]----o [GND]
                                  |
                                  +----> Host [MISO] (3.3V safe)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BUS TOPOLOGY (ISO 11898-2 HIGH SPEED CAN):

  [ NODE 1 ] <====================== LINE BUS ======================> [ NODE N ]
 (Terminated                                                          (Terminated
   120 Ohm)               [ NODE 2 ]            [ NODE 3 ]              120 Ohm)
                             |                     |
                      (No Termination)      (No Termination)
================================================================================
